<title>SOUTH AFRICA: POLL - S.African economic indicators consensus.</title>
<headline>POLL - S.African economic indicators consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African economic indicators scheduled for release next week include:</p>
<p>DAY----GMT---INDICATOR----PERIOD--FORECAST---RANGE-----PREVIOUS</p>
<p>WED+   1000  TRADE	  JUN     +1.28 BLN +0.8/+1.8  +1.75</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Economists said their forecasts for the trade balance were only an indication as the figure was difficult to forecast.</p>
<p>The data is volatile due to the inclusion of trade statistics from Botswana, Lesotho, Namibia and Swaziland.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
